{
  "title": "Morning Star I",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Morning Star I</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Complete <a href=\"/wiki/Banners_Never_Fall_(Quest)\" title=\"Banners Never Fall (Quest)\">Banners Never Fall (Quest)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/A_Stranger_in_a_Strange_Land\" title=\"A Stranger in a Strange Land\">A Stranger in a Strange Land</a></i> in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_II\" title=\"Chapter II\">Chapter II</a>&#58; Act Segue</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City Square</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The crisis is over, but Rinascita still has a long road ahead of it...</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">N/A</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Morning_Star_II\" title=\"Morning Star II\">Morning Star II</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Calaris\" title=\"Calaris\">Calaris</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Phoebe\" title=\"Phoebe\">Phoebe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tulio\" title=\"Tulio\">Tulio</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Story_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Story Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Head to Ragunna and learn about the recovery efforts from Phoebe</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>It is not required to fully clear <a href=\"/wiki/Banners_Never_Fall\" title=\"Banners Never Fall\">Banners Never Fall</a> to start.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Story_Notes\">Story Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>While not a prerequisite, this quest line involves characters from following side quests and may contain spoilers.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hymn_of_the_Sea_of_Clouds:_Rainbow\" title=\"Hymn of the Sea of Clouds: Rainbow\">Hymn of the Sea of Clouds: Rainbow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hymn_of_the_Sea_of_Clouds:_Storm\" title=\"Hymn of the Sea of Clouds: Storm\">Hymn of the Sea of Clouds: Storm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Flames_in_the_Deep\" title=\"Flames in the Deep\">Flames in the Deep</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Deep_Sea_Survey\" title=\"Deep Sea Survey\">Deep Sea Survey</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>Two Acolytes discussing amongst each other</dt>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>Acolyte Phoebe has been awfully busy lately</dt></dl></dd>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>Can't be helped. Barlin and Gnessa martyred themselves, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Fabricatorium_of_the_Deep\" title=\"Fabricatorium of the Deep\">Fabricatorium</a> is a make or break for the entire Common Echo system, so Acolyte Luther has to be there in person.</dt></dl></dd>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>And Priest Alessio runs off at a time like this? Unbelievable.</dt></dl></dd>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>Came as quite a shock for me as well.</dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Two Gladiators telling their tale to a crowd</dt>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>Just when things got tense, my battle-hardened body didn't fail me. A single sidestep and I dodged Lupa's spear just like that!</dt></dl></dd>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>Oh, please. The way that spear sent you flying, I had to drag you out!</dt></dl></dd>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>Oh, you're so full of it!</dt></dl></dd>\n<dd>\n<dl><dt>No, you are!</dt></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Phoebe:</b> O lost souls adrift in surging tides, may your frequencies find peace. May my prayers accompany you back to the high heavens.</dd>\n<dd><b>Calaris:</b> Acolyte Phoebe, can our prayers really reach those devoured by the Dark Tide? Or will they also...</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Follow your heart. Do what's right.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Yes. A sincere heart can surely pierce through the haze of the Dark Tide!</dd>\n<dd><b>Calaris:</b> I see. We will carry on our prayers for the fallen!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> How are the rebuilding efforts going, Phoebe?</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> All the Acolytes dispatched are working tirelessly, but the situation remains grim...</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Many of the faithful have come seeking aid from the Order. But even more arrive unsure if they can still trust us.</dd>\n<dd><b>Calaris:</b> Acolyte Phoebe, I've put together a list of missing Acolytes from the Fabricatorium of the Deep. Acolyte Luther is counting on your help to coordinate the response.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Another one? Very well, I'll take care of it right after I finish the list from Ragunna City.</dd>\n<dd><b>A name suddenly flashes through your mind: Lenore. Did she got to the Fabricatorium? Could her name be on the list?</b></dd>\n<dd><b>Tulio:</b> We've also encountered a few obstacles in Septimont's Old District. The faithful there are requesting Resonator and Common Echo support.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> We don't have extra hands to spare. I'll go to Septimont and handle the matter myself!</dd>\n<dd><b>Calaris:</b> But Acolyte Phoebe, what about the missing Acolytes from the Fabricatorium? The Privy Council also expects you to brief them in tomorrow morning's meeting.</dd>\n<dd><b>Tulio:</b> There's also the Montelli interim shipping agreement to sign, and the Fisalia pharmacists must still be escorted to the hunting grounds to treat the wounded. Acolyte Luther is hoping you can...</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (Looks like Phoebe is swamped at the moment. Better give her a hand before she gets overwhelmed.)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> I can help cover some of those, Phoebe.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> No, it's all right. I can take care of it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Shouldering every responsibility can sometimes be irresponsible in itself.</dd>\n<dd><b>Calaris:</b> I couldn't agree more. Acolyte Phoebe, let us share the burden!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Leave the tasks in Septimont to me. I've gotten pretty familiar with the area.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> ...Very well. I'll send over the locations and requirement shortly. Thank you, truly.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Tulio was an Acolyte that went missing back in Version 2.0 release. Despite being involved in this particular quest, implying his return to Ragunna City, <a href=\"/wiki/Figaro\" title=\"Figaro\">Figaro</a> still continues praying for his safe return.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Morning Star I</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">黎明之星（一）</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\